{
  "uid": "homelab-security",
  "title": "Homelab / Security",
  "description": "TLS as served, authentication errors at the API server and the public endpoints, Secret age and image hygiene.",
  "tags": [
    "homelab",
    "security"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "TLS",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Certificate expiry (as served)",
      "description": "probe_ssl_earliest_cert_expiry per public hostname, in days.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(min by (app) (probe_ssl_earliest_cert_expiry{job=\"blackbox-public\"}) - time()) / 86400",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 14
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 21
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 90,
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "TLS version and HTTP status per hostname",
      "description": "probe_tls_version_info and probe_http_status_code from the public probes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (app, version) (probe_tls_version_info{job=\"blackbox-public\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (app) (probe_http_status_code{job=\"blackbox-public\"})",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value #A": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #B": "HTTP status",
              "version": "TLS"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Authentication",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Kubernetes API: 401/403 per second",
      "description": "apiserver_request_total with code 401 or 403: rejected credentials and denied requests at the API server.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (code, resource) (rate(apiserver_request_total{code=~\"401|403\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{code}} {{resource}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Public endpoints answering 401/403",
      "description": "Public probes whose last status was 401 or 403. Expected: theater (SSO proxy). Anything else means an app started demanding credentials on its health path.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "probe_http_status_code{job=\"blackbox-public\"} == 401 or probe_http_status_code{job=\"blackbox-public\"} == 403",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "probe": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "status"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Secrets and images",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Secret age (days)",
      "description": "kube_secret_created per Secret, by name only. Values are never read. Service-account tokens and Helm release Secrets are excluded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sort_desc((time() - kube_secret_created{namespace=~\"argo|keycloak|monitoring|immich|theater|mealie|paperless|seafile|syncthing|cert-manager|external-dns|gateway|democratic-csi|kube-system\"} unless on (namespace, secret) kube_secret_type{type=~\"kubernetes.io/service-account-token|helm.sh/release.v1\"}) / 86400)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "color-background"
            }
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 180
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 365
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "container": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "pod": true,
              "service": true,
              "uid": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "age (days)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Images without a pinned tag",
      "description": "Running containers whose image has no tag or uses :latest.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count by (namespace, pod, container, image) (kube_pod_container_info{image=~\".*:latest|[^:]+\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Distinct images running",
      "description": "count of distinct images in kube_pod_container_info: the set a vulnerability scanner would have to cover.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (image) (kube_pod_container_info))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "images",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Not available yet",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Data sources this dashboard does not have",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "- **Trivy findings and image CVE counts**: trivy-operator is not deployed. CI scans manifests and images (Trivy gate), the cluster does not.\n- **Keycloak failed logins**: Keycloak runs with `KC_METRICS_ENABLED=true` but without event metrics (`KC_EVENT_METRICS_USER_ENABLED`) and nothing scrapes its management port (9000).\n- **Auth errors at the Gateway**: Cilium's Envoy and Hubble HTTP metrics are not enabled or scraped, so per-route 401/403/5xx rates are not in Prometheus.\n\nSee docs/observability.md for what each needs."
      },
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      }
    }
  ]
}
